to track the category on twitch, you will need to set a global variable with the value "%gameName%" 
this will safe the category name and makes it usable for the code


How to create Global Variable

Click on the "Global Variables" on the top menu.
Then right click -> Add Variable
Put in a name. For example "current_game"
For the value: %gameName%

Witth that the streamer.bot will save the category from twitch in the variable "current_game"


After that we will add an action that will trigger when we change the category on twitch

So add the action, give it a name an then we will add the trigger.

the trigger we use is under twitch > general > stream update
we will not be editing the trigger, so you can leave it as it is.

For the sub action we will set the global variable
Add > Core > Global > Global Set

an there we will put in our "current_game" and the value "%gameName%"
